Passives are special upgrades that you can obtain in a run. They can be leveled up to 3, have unique effects, and some can also be evolved using the [[Fusion Reactor]], just like [[balls]], but they can't be fused. The player starts with a few passives unlocked, and as they complete certain [[levels]], more passives become available.

== Passive Types ==
There are 2 types of passives: '''Base Passives''' and '''Evolved Passives'''.

=== Base Passives ===
Base Passives can be offered to the player when they level up as long as they have them unlocked, and some specific Base Passives can be combined together to create Evolved Passives. There are currently 54 Base Passives in the game.

Most Base Passives can be offered as long as the player has a passive slot available, however, some passives do have extra requirements for them to be offered, mainly (but not restricted to) passives that are related to specific [[Status Effects|status effects]], which require you to have a ball that can apply that specific status effect to enemies for the passive to be offered.

